1
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:04,788
In Calapan City, education opens doors,

2
00:00:04,788 --> 00:00:07,243
and scholarships help keep them open.

3
00:00:07,593 --> 00:00:10,729
Every year, the City Education Department, or CED,

4
00:00:10,729 --> 00:00:14,494
supports deserving students through its scholarship program.

5
00:00:15,494 --> 00:00:19,551
But behind every scholar is a trail of paper: application forms,

6
00:00:19,551 --> 00:00:23,354
photocopied documents, and requirements submitted in person.

7
00:00:23,704 --> 00:00:26,921
Records are kept in folders, logbooks, and spreadsheets,

8
00:00:26,921 --> 00:00:29,276
and they are checked and updated by hand.

9
00:00:30,276 --> 00:00:33,090
Applicants line up to submit their requirements,

10
00:00:33,090 --> 00:00:36,198
while staff sort, verify, and file each one manually.

11
00:00:36,548 --> 00:00:38,389
As the number of scholars grows,

12
00:00:38,389 --> 00:00:40,920
keeping everything organized becomes harder.

13
00:00:42,120 --> 00:00:43,834
This is where our project begins.

14
00:00:45,434 --> 00:00:48,434
ISKONNECT: a Mobile-Based Scholarship Management

15
00:00:48,434 --> 00:00:51,498
System for the Calapan City Education Department.

16
00:00:52,298 --> 00:00:56,108
It was developed to connect scholarship applicants, scholars,

17
00:00:56,108 --> 00:00:59,169
and CED through one centralized digital platform.

18
00:01:03,369 --> 00:01:06,968
Let's first look at how the scholarship process generally works today.

19
00:01:07,318 --> 00:01:09,479
An applicant submits the requirements,

20
00:01:09,479 --> 00:01:12,494
takes the examination, and goes through an interview.

21
00:01:12,844 --> 00:01:15,202
Applicants are then evaluated and ranked,

22
00:01:15,202 --> 00:01:17,674
and those who are selected become scholars.

23
00:01:18,674 --> 00:01:20,098
But the journey doesn't end there.

24
00:01:20,448 --> 00:01:23,036
Each semester, scholars submit their subjects,

25
00:01:23,036 --> 00:01:25,624
and their grades and attendance are monitored.

26
00:01:25,974 --> 00:01:29,592
They keep their requirements updated until graduation,

27
00:01:29,592 --> 00:01:32,474
and CED continues to track them even after.

28
00:01:33,474 --> 00:01:37,068
Many of these activities still rely on printed documents,

29
00:01:37,068 --> 00:01:39,842
spreadsheets, and face-to-face transactions.

30
00:01:44,242 --> 00:01:47,612
Over time, this manual approach creates real challenges.

31
00:01:48,212 --> 00:01:51,319
Scholars are difficult to track throughout their scholarship journey.

32
00:01:51,669 --> 00:01:54,387
Records are paper-based and maintained by hand.

33
00:01:54,737 --> 00:01:56,984
Grades and attendance are hard to monitor.

34
00:01:57,334 --> 00:01:58,930
Reports take time to prepare.

35
00:01:59,280 --> 00:02:02,441
Requirements and documents are difficult to organize.

36
00:02:02,791 --> 00:02:05,174
Physical records can be lost or damaged.

37
00:02:05,524 --> 00:02:07,913
Student status is hard to check at a glance.

38
00:02:08,263 --> 00:02:11,449
And announcements don't always reach every scholar on time.

39
00:02:15,249 --> 00:02:19,392
None of this is anyone's fault. The process has simply outgrown paper.

40
00:02:19,892 --> 00:02:22,020
So we asked ourselves a simple question.

41
00:02:22,620 --> 00:02:25,566
What if applying for a scholarship took minutes, not days?

42
00:02:26,266 --> 00:02:28,663
What if every requirement, every grade,

43
00:02:28,663 --> 00:02:31,735
and every attendance record was just one tap away?

44
00:02:32,435 --> 00:02:36,283
What if CED could follow every scholar's journey, all in one place?

45
00:02:37,183 --> 00:02:38,147
Well, now it can.

46
00:02:40,347 --> 00:02:41,786
Say hello to ISKONNECT!

47
00:02:42,886 --> 00:02:44,018
So, what's in a name?

48
00:02:44,518 --> 00:02:47,566
ISKO is what Filipinos lovingly call a scholar.

49
00:02:48,066 --> 00:02:51,137
And KONNECT stands for the connection between scholars

50
00:02:51,137 --> 00:02:53,525
and the Calapan City Education Department.

51
00:02:53,875 --> 00:02:56,816
Put them together, and you get one platform that

52
00:02:56,816 --> 00:03:00,124
brings scholarship information, processes, monitoring,

53
00:03:00,124 --> 00:03:02,697
communication, and records into one place.

54
00:03:06,697 --> 00:03:10,781
Behind ISKONNECT is a team of connected components. Let's meet them.

55
00:03:11,131 --> 00:03:12,588
First up, the Student App:

56
00:03:12,588 --> 00:03:15,725
a scholarship companion that lives right in your pocket.

57
00:03:16,075 --> 00:03:19,444
Profile, scholarship details, requirements, subjects,

58
00:03:19,444 --> 00:03:22,305
grades, attendance, announcements, schedules,

59
00:03:22,305 --> 00:03:25,419
messages, and scholarship status, all in one app.

60
00:03:25,769 --> 00:03:29,234
Next is the brain of the operation: the central backend

61
00:03:29,234 --> 00:03:32,888
and database, where every record is kept safe and in sync.

62
00:03:33,888 --> 00:03:37,204
Then there's mission control: the CED Admin Dashboard.

63
00:03:37,554 --> 00:03:41,942
Here, authorized staff manage applicants and scholars, requirements,

64
00:03:41,942 --> 00:03:44,846
grades, attendance, announcements, schedules,

65
00:03:44,846 --> 00:03:49,364
and reports, along with documents, scholar history, and communication.

66
00:03:50,364 --> 00:03:53,624
And finally, the attendance hero: the QR Scanner App.

67
00:03:53,974 --> 00:03:56,327
It scans scholar QR codes in seconds,

68
00:03:56,327 --> 00:04:00,523
keeps working even without internet, stores records on the device,

69
00:04:00,523 --> 00:04:03,257
and syncs everything once it's back online.

70
00:04:03,607 --> 00:04:05,940
Together, they form one connected system.

71
00:04:11,540 --> 00:04:15,030
Now, let's follow Juan, a future scholar from Calapan,

72
00:04:15,030 --> 00:04:20,070
on his journey through ISKONNECT, from application, to graduation, and beyond.

73
00:04:21,470 --> 00:04:24,610
It starts when an applicant opens the ISKONNECT mobile app.

74
00:04:24,960 --> 00:04:28,328
They register or log in, set up their applicant profile,

75
00:04:28,328 --> 00:04:30,794
and fill out the scholarship application.

76
00:04:31,144 --> 00:04:34,092
Next, the requirements are uploaded digitally.

77
00:04:34,092 --> 00:04:36,912
No long lines, and no stacks of photocopies.

78
00:04:37,262 --> 00:04:40,900
Once submitted, the applicant's information and documents

79
00:04:40,900 --> 00:04:44,155
become accessible to authorized CED administrators.

80
00:04:45,555 --> 00:04:47,513
As the application moves forward,

81
00:04:47,513 --> 00:04:51,370
the applicant receives the examination schedule right in the app.

82
00:04:51,720 --> 00:04:54,825
After the examination, the interview schedule follows.

83
00:04:55,175 --> 00:04:58,475
On the admin dashboard, CED manages these schedules

84
00:04:58,475 --> 00:05:01,711
and keeps every applicant's information organized.

85
00:05:03,111 --> 00:05:04,511
Next comes evaluation.

86
00:05:04,861 --> 00:05:07,860
CED considers the examination, the applicant's

87
00:05:07,860 --> 00:05:10,793
economic background, and the panel interview.

88
00:05:11,143 --> 00:05:13,747
Applicants are then evaluated and ranked,

89
00:05:13,747 --> 00:05:15,905
and CED makes the final selection.

90
00:05:16,255 --> 00:05:18,391
The number of available scholar slots

91
00:05:18,391 --> 00:05:20,642
depends on the program's annual budget.

92
00:05:20,992 --> 00:05:25,449
ISKONNECT does not decide who becomes a scholar. It helps CED manage

93
00:05:25,449 --> 00:05:29,447
and record each step of the evaluation and selection process.

94
00:05:30,847 --> 00:05:33,529
For successful applicants, this is a milestone.

95
00:05:33,879 --> 00:05:36,854
Their status changes from applicant to active scholar.

96
00:05:37,204 --> 00:05:41,581
Each scholar now has a digital profile, with personal information,

97
00:05:41,581 --> 00:05:46,289
school, program, scholarship details, status, and academic information.

98
00:05:47,689 --> 00:05:50,591
Every semester follows a clear, repeating cycle.

99
00:05:50,941 --> 00:05:54,736
When the semester begins, the scholar submits their enrolled subjects.

100
00:05:55,086 --> 00:05:58,865
Academic progress and attendance are monitored throughout the term,

101
00:05:58,865 --> 00:06:01,798
and requirements are submitted or updated as needed.

102
00:06:02,148 --> 00:06:04,464
Scholars upload their Certificate of Grades,

103
00:06:04,464 --> 00:06:06,569
but they do not encode their own grades.

104
00:06:06,919 --> 00:06:10,901
Official grades are encoded by authorized CED administrators.

105
00:06:11,251 --> 00:06:13,858
CED then monitors the scholarship standing,

106
00:06:13,858 --> 00:06:16,707
and the cycle continues into the next semester.

107
00:06:18,107 --> 00:06:22,234
Attendance at scholarship activities is recorded using QR codes.

108
00:06:22,584 --> 00:06:26,855
Each scholar has a personal QR code on their digital Scholarship ID.

109
00:06:27,205 --> 00:06:29,776
At the event, CED staff scan it using

110
00:06:29,776 --> 00:06:32,416
the separate ISKONNECT QR Scanner app.

111
00:06:32,766 --> 00:06:34,873
Each scan becomes an attendance record.

112
00:06:35,223 --> 00:06:38,753
Without internet, records are stored locally on the device,

113
00:06:38,753 --> 00:06:41,506
then synchronized once the connection returns.

114
00:06:41,856 --> 00:06:44,595
The attendance then appears on the admin dashboard.

115
00:06:45,995 --> 00:06:49,229
ISKONNECT also helps CED keep an eye on attendance.

116
00:06:49,579 --> 00:06:51,708
When a scholar reaches two absences,

117
00:06:51,708 --> 00:06:54,665
the system flags it and alerts the administrators.

118
00:06:55,015 --> 00:06:57,802
The system does not terminate a scholarship on its own.

119
00:06:58,152 --> 00:07:01,831
Instead, an administrator reviews the case and decides on the

120
00:07:01,831 --> 00:07:05,269
appropriate action, based on the scholar's circumstances.

121
00:07:06,669 --> 00:07:08,932
Requirements are easy to keep track of, too.

122
00:07:09,282 --> 00:07:12,245
Scholars can see exactly which documents are needed,

123
00:07:12,245 --> 00:07:13,898
and upload them from the app.

124
00:07:14,248 --> 00:07:17,329
Each requirement moves from Pending, to Submitted,

125
00:07:17,329 --> 00:07:20,103
to Verified once an administrator reviews it.

126
00:07:20,453 --> 00:07:24,234
If a document needs correction, the administrator can return it

127
00:07:24,234 --> 00:07:27,535
with remarks, so the scholar knows exactly what to fix.

128
00:07:28,935 --> 00:07:31,556
Staying connected is at the heart of ISKONNECT.

129
00:07:31,906 --> 00:07:34,938
An administrator creates an announcement on the dashboard,

130
00:07:35,288 --> 00:07:36,918
and it reaches the student app,

131
00:07:36,918 --> 00:07:39,442
with a notification even when the app is closed.

132
00:07:39,792 --> 00:07:43,653
Schedules, reminders, and scholarship updates arrive directly,

133
00:07:43,653 --> 00:07:46,456
and scholars can message CED through the app.

134
00:07:47,856 --> 00:07:52,306
For CED, all of this information comes together on the admin dashboard.

135
00:07:52,656 --> 00:07:57,625
Scholar and applicant records, academic information, attendance, requirements,

136
00:07:57,625 --> 00:08:01,448
and scholarship status are organized by school and category.

137
00:08:01,798 --> 00:08:05,343
With charts, statistics, and ready-to-generate reports,

138
00:08:05,343 --> 00:08:09,340
CED can monitor scholars and prepare reports more efficiently.

139
00:08:10,740 --> 00:08:14,097
ISKONNECT keeps each scholar's history, from start to finish.

140
00:08:14,447 --> 00:08:17,084
From applicant, to scholar, to active status.

141
00:08:17,434 --> 00:08:19,896
If a scholarship is stopped or terminated,

142
00:08:19,896 --> 00:08:22,768
that decision is recorded as part of the history.

143
00:08:23,118 --> 00:08:27,001
For graduates, tracking continues, whether they become employed,

144
00:08:27,001 --> 00:08:30,520
pass a board examination, or pursue post-graduate studies.

145
00:08:30,870 --> 00:08:33,492
Instead of disconnected semester records,

146
00:08:33,492 --> 00:08:36,561
CED sees one continuous story for every scholar.

147
00:08:37,961 --> 00:08:40,870
Put together, this is the complete ISKONNECT cycle.

148
00:08:41,220 --> 00:08:44,772
Application, evaluation, selection, and becoming a scholar.

149
00:08:45,122 --> 00:08:48,536
Semester monitoring, attendance, requirements, and grades.

150
00:08:48,886 --> 00:08:51,275
Reports and monitoring, all the way to

151
00:08:51,275 --> 00:08:53,790
graduation and post-graduation tracking.

152
00:08:54,140 --> 00:08:58,349
One continuous flow, connecting CED, ISKONNECT, and its scholars.

153
00:09:02,749 --> 00:09:05,453
So, what does this mean for CED and its scholars?

154
00:09:05,803 --> 00:09:09,295
Centralized scholarship records, and easier scholar monitoring.

155
00:09:09,645 --> 00:09:13,905
Organized requirements, with digital academic and attendance monitoring.

156
00:09:14,255 --> 00:09:17,554
Faster access to information, better communication,

157
00:09:17,554 --> 00:09:19,495
and easier report preparation.

158
00:09:19,845 --> 00:09:22,227
Better tracking of each scholar's history,

159
00:09:22,227 --> 00:09:24,554
with less dependence on physical records.

160
00:09:25,554 --> 00:09:28,118
ISKONNECT helps make scholarship management

161
00:09:28,118 --> 00:09:30,624
more organized, accessible, and connected.

162
00:09:34,624 --> 00:09:35,385
ISKONNECT.

163
00:09:36,285 --> 00:09:38,977
Connecting scholars. Empowering education.

